  {
    "command": "set_still_image",
    "id": "card/normal/938"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「月がきれいね……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「ほら。手すりの上にのぼったら、手が届きそうになるくらいに近いわね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「んん。弾き語りしたい気分になっちゃうけれど！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「なんの曲がいいかしらね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「こないだの芋掘りを歌にしたもの……は、ムードをぶち壊しちゃうかもしれないから、やめておくけれど？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「それより、メッセージを読んでくれてありがとう……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「あたしは学校にいられなかったから、あたしの友達に、手伝ってもらったんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「クロちゃんに頼んだら怒られるだろうから、演劇部の友達にね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「みどりちゃん。体験入部、楽しかったけれど♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「……あたしね。健康に戻れた、って思ってたけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「やっぱり駄目みたいで、また、病院に戻らないといけなくって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「ほんとうは、いけないのだろうけど、みどりちゃんにお別れを言うために、夜に病院から出てきたんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「軽音楽部に戻ったあと、クロちゃんといつまでも一緒に演奏していたかったけれど、体調を崩しちゃってね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「それで、夕方にはまた入院。二年前はもっと元気だったのにね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「急に園芸部を抜け出して、軽音部に行って……あなたには、悪いことをしちゃった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「そう思ってるの。ごめんなさい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「ねぇ、みどりちゃん。あなたは運命を信じてる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「あたしはね……信じてる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「かつて、あたしは神話に憧れた少女だった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「『中二病』だ、とか言われちゃうくらいには詳しくってね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「ホメーロスの詩を、たくさん読んだの。擦り切れるほどに読んだの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「でも、きっと古代ギリシア語を訳せるひとが少なかったのね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「全訳の本は置いてなくて、しかたなく部分的な……抄訳のものを読んだの。何度も、何度も」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「そのなかには、よっつの話が載っていて。なかでも記憶に残ったのが、『デーメーテール讃歌』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「慈愛と豊饒の神、セレス。またの名をデーメーテール。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「彼女が連れ去られた娘のペルセフォネーのために、冥府まで下っていくお話」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「みどりちゃんと出会って、一緒に芋掘りをして……あたしは思ったの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「甲斐甲斐しく花壇のお世話をするあなたは、強くて、やさしくって……まるで神様みたいだなって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「だからあたしは、あなたに花冠を渡したの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「憧れだった神話の登場人物に会えた、その運命に感謝をして、ね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「……冥府に下ったセレスは、娘を救って、最後にどうなったと思う？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「最後に……彼女は季節を与えたの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「あたしたちが四季を感じられるのは、きっとそのため」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「みどりちゃん。今まで、ずっと入院してたあたしに……季節をくれて、ありがとう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「園芸部の活動、楽しかったけれど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「病院はとても窮屈。季節のない、冥府みたいなところ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「だけど、みどりちゃんはあたしのために、ちゃんとここに来てくれた。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「あたしにはクロちゃんやみどりちゃんや……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「ほかにも、たくさんの気にかけてくれるひとがいるって、ちゃんと証明してくれた」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「だから、大丈夫。きっとまた、みんなの前に元気な姿を見せられると思ってる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「もう、クロちゃんにはお別れを言ったのだけれど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「あなたに黙って学校を去るのも、なんだかしのびなかったから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「だから、ここに呼ばせてもらったの。あたしの大好きな、この屋上に」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「んん。ごめんね。ずいぶんと、長く話しちゃったけれど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「病院の先生に怒られないように、今日はすぐに戻るつもり。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「一方的に話しちゃって、ごめんなさい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「だけど……いつかきっと、また一緒に園芸部の活動ができるっと、信じてる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-a-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-a-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「ありがとう、みどりちゃん。さようなら」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「また、会えるといいけれど……♪」"
  }
]